\f0\fs24 \cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
<!$Scr_Ps::0><$Scr_Ps::1>
\f1\fs22 Chip didn\'92t do nervous, but he recognised Alexander\'92s manipulation of facts for the danger it posed, and wondered how Alexander would process his interview. Backstage, he couldn\'92t even take the weight of his feet, such was his need to stand through the next segment.\
\'93What you\'92ll see next,\'94 Alexander said to camera, \'93is an interview I had earlier today with an ex-Fridge Force weapons expert, who I discovered had been arrested by Eloise Shakti and imprisoned in her own personal jailhouse, for raising concerns about the dangers of a Shakti Enterprises weapons development program called Project Kebab. As you\'92ll see the interview is conducted in the actual jailhouse, and I was so personally convinced of the man\'92s innocence I decided to rescue him, only to become embroiled in a confrontation with Eloise Shakti who demanded that the weapons expert be put back in the cell.\'94\
Alexander faced another camera, which tracked him walking out into the audience.\
\'93Now I need to tell you, I might have ended up in the next cell, if it were not for the brave security personnel of\'97\'94\
Alexander was drowned out by the cheering of the uniformed necks in the crowd, who rose to their feet and applauded. He smiled and lamely tried to wave them down, and basked in fifteen or twenty seconds of the adulation of the coercive controlling, child-threatening, bullying, compassion-shaming, oversized-dog-owning, man-cave-decorating, tax-avoiding, fat-shaming, handshake-crushing, bar-staff-lecturing, housework-evading, anniversary-forgetting, phone-inspecting, clothing-approving, location-tracking, silence-punishing, welfare-policing, subsidy-pocketing, homeless-blaming, charity-sneering, barbecue-monopolising, salad-ridiculing, sunscreen-refusing, therapy-deriding, free-speech-demanding, dissent-silencing\'85\
\'85dickheads.\
\'93Thank you for your service, every one of you. Your dedication to truth and freedom is truly, authentically heartwarming.\'94 Alexander loved people who made an effort to appear authentic. \'93Thank you, thank you.\'94\
They kept cheering.\
\'93Shall we go on with the show?\'94 Alexander asked.\
Eventually the wife-monitoring, custody-weaponising, flag-draping\'85\
\'85crowd settled down.\
\'93The man you rescued is here with us tonight! And here\'92s his testimony. We have, of course, altered his appearance and voice to protect his identity. Roll the package.\'94\
The package rolled and the Chip Stockwell standing backstage watching the Chip Stockwell on the broadcast swore from the very beginning as the Alexander on the broadcast opened with, \'93Mr Chip Stockwell, thanks for joining us.\'94\
Chip cursed. Alexander had never said those words in his presence. Worse, the interviewee had Mr Chip Stockwell\'92s exact face. They hadn\'92t altered so much as a pimple.
